.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
# /ios is intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# Expo ignores it by default because `expo prebuild` regenerates it. But this
# project carries two hand-applied fixes in there without which the build fails
# on any path containing a space (this repo lives under ".../Summer Stuff/..."):
#
#   ios/Podfile                     — post_install hook quoting $PODS_TARGET_SRCROOT
#   ios/mobile.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj — quotes RN's backtick-expanded script path
#
# Losing those means a fresh clone can't compile. Pods/ and build/ stay ignored
# below, so what's actually committed is ~24 small files.
/android
